# Civic Aid Pipeline

> Automated public benefits and emergency assistance orchestrator that evaluates household eligibility across SNAP, Medicaid, LIHEAP, and Indiana FSSA programs from a single intake profile, generates pre-filled application packets, and tracks annual recertification deadlines.

## Architecture

```text
civic-aid-pipeline/
├── apps/
│   └── aid-api-gateway/         # Express server evaluating eligibility & generating packets (Port 4300)
├── packages/
│   ├── eligibility-engine/      # Evaluates SNAP, LIHEAP & Indiana Medicaid / HIP 2.0 thresholds
│   └── form-autofiller/         # Generates IN-Bridges portal payloads & recertification dates
├── schemas/
│   └── household-intake.json    # Standardized member household intake JSON Schema
├── package.json
└── tsconfig.json
